      "message": "Will need another trybot run...\n\nDW\u0027s generateMetrics wants to call getPath(), which wants to mutate the SkGlyph object. This was allowed before, and with the alternate CL to this one...\n\nhttps://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/726936\n\nWe can:\n\n1. modify the DW context to just get the path, but not go through the glyph/context machinery, which would mean we wouldn\u0027t cache the path for them.\n\n2. go with the alt CL (which is much less invasive than this one) and postpone the idea of a large-scale cleanup to another effort.\n\nThoughts?\n\nI vote for #2, as it would allow a minimalist way forward to unfriend classes (the original goal), but not close the door on a more exciting future CL that cleans up this flow, but ready to hear alternatives.",
